    "clauseId": "conditional-block-1",
    "field": [
      "blocks",
      1,
      "text"
    ],
    "quote": "Death Blow: If this model is destroyed by a melee attack, if it has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 4+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.",
